## ✅ Full name: TAG(16:0/18:1(9Z)/16:0)

A **triacylglycerol** — the primary form of energy storage in adipose tissue. No charge, no headgroup, highly hydrophobic. TAGs are stored in lipid droplets and mobilised by lipases during fasting.

